Fri Feb 20 22:34:06 PST 1981

No promises are made that the binaries on this tape correspond
to the sources, since no standard v6 or v7 systems are around to test them
on.  The v6 binaries are the same ones that were on 2bsd, except that
the ex and csh binaries have been updated.  The v7 binaries
were taken from our Cory system, so may involve modifications made by
the Cory people.  For example, they use buffered stdio.
We recommend that you recompile everything (unless you have a vanilla
version 6 system and cannot recompile).
